{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03850","headline":"始背洛城秋郊瞩目奉怀台中诸侍御 · 苏味道","name":"始背洛城秋郊瞩目奉怀台中诸侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄游忝霜署，直指戒冰心。\n荔浦方南纪，蘅臯暂北临。\n山晴关塞断，川暮广城阴。\n场圃通圭甸，沟塍碍石林。\n野童来捃拾，田叟去讴吟。\n蟋蟀秋风起，蒹葭晚露深。\n帝城犹郁郁，征传几駸駸。\n回忆披书地，劳歌谢所钦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏味道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}